  "notes":"Manifest v26 adds permission-first device temporal context and shared-transcript following. Chat no longer attaches device time until the user explicitly allows it; declined/unset state tells the LALM not to make user-local time claims. Profile city/state/country fields are stored but deliberately not used for timezone resolution yet. Transcript sync remains fail-closed and can follow shared-private-blob-v1 checkpoints when stable Server 2.3.108 is deployed, without reverting to legacy replay as a hidden fallback."
